{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124307","id":4792965031,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHa7Xpw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124307","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124307.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124307.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124307","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124307/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124307/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124307/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cf7e9b929d7beb82db88ed5bf107fa3c665de8a3","number":124307,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix node references in arrays lost on scene reimport","user":{"login":"wenqiangwang","id":3119363,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMTkzNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3119363?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang","html_url":"https://github.com/wenqiangwang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wenqiangwang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When a scene re-import re-creates its nodes, the editor re-applies staged node modifications from a table that stores node references as NodePaths. This protection only covered single node references (`@export var x: Node3D`); arrays of nodes (`Array[Node3D]`) stored raw object pointers that became stale after re-creation, leaving the property null or corrupted.\r\n\r\nAdd convert_node_refs_to_paths() and is_node_array_property() and use them in the record (revert + reimport) and restore paths so single refs and arrays of Nodes are all stored as paths and re-resolved. is_node_array_property() decodes the hint_string element encoding so only true node arrays are handled (not e.g. Array[NodePath]).\r\n\r\nFixes #124294\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id